        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Engage Venoxis before bursting him and avoid all poison hazards if he survives.\n\n1. Enter Heroic Zul'Gurub and reach High Priest Venoxis. Disable attacking pets and start with a non-damaging taunt or other harmless pull.\n\n2. Let Venoxis move off his stairs and the encounter initialize, then kill him directly. Later Retail comments confirm that waiting for the snake transformation is unnecessary for a high-level kill.\n\n3. If he survives, stay out of Venomous Effusion, poison clouds and the moving poison trails. Move apart to break Toxic Link without crossing hazards, then finish the boss. If effects are invisible, check particle-density settings before another attempt.",
