        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Kill Halazzi without destroying his totems.\n\n1. For Midnight access, select legacy Quel'Thalas with Zidormi at Thalassian Pass, then enter the Heroic Zul'Aman dungeon in Ghostlands. The new outdoor Zul'Aman is different content. Reach Halazzi in the northeastern temple.\n\n2. Kill Halazzi directly with single-target damage. Leave his totems alive throughout the fight. Disable passive area attacks, cleaving pets and the archaeology bear-cub buff, which older comments report can destroy a totem automatically.\n\n3. If he survives long enough to place a healing totem, move him away from its green healing area and keep attacking him. The achievement does not require you to kill a totem or wait for a specific number of spawns.",
