    [5754] = {
        achievementId = 5754,
        name = "Drown Your Sorrows",
        category = "Exploration",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Drown Your Sorrows",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Ten distinct drinks, with a Vashj'ir vendor and four brewed recipes.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ten distinct drinks, with a Vashj'ir vendor and four brewed recipes.\n\n1. Track all TEN drinks and consume one of each exact name. You can buy finished tradeable drinks from the Auction House or another cook; having Cooking yourself is optional. Fresh Water, Highland Spring Water and Highland Spirits are THREE different criteria.\n\n2. At Innkeeper Allison in Stormwind (60.4,75.2) or Innkeeper Gryshka in Orgrimmar (53.4,78.8), buy and drink Fresh Water, Sparkling Oasis Water and Highland Spring Water. These three ordinary vendor waters provide three checkmarks.\n\n3. Visit Gronk Hamcheeks beside the Crucible of Carnage grill in Twilight Highlands (50.4,58.4). Buy and drink Murky Water and Fungus Squeezings. Gronk is the usable alternative to old phased Hyjal merchants; you do not have to farm trash drops or restart the Hyjal storyline.\n\n4. Go to Silvertide Hollow, Shimmering Expanse, and enter the air-filled cave around 49.2,42.0. Buy Greasy Whale Milk from Caretaker Movra and drink it. Swim into the cave rather than looking at the sea surface directly above the map pin.\n\n5. Obtain the four COOKED drinks: Darkbrew Lager, Highland Spirits, South Island Iced Tea and Starfire Espresso. Buy finished drinks or make them with Cataclysm Cooking. Darkbrew Lager is trainer-taught; the capital sous-chefs Jon Casper / Shazdar sell the other recipes for Epicurean's Awards earned from Cooking dailies.\n\n6. To brew them: Darkbrew Lager uses a Jug of Badlands Bourbon and TWO Skins of Dwarven Stout from a drink vendor. Highland Spirits uses Highland Pomegranate plus Refreshing Spring Water; South Island Iced Tea uses Tropical Sunfruit plus water; Starfire Espresso uses Cocoa Beans plus water. Buy cocoa through the award vendor's Imported Supplies or the Auction House. Buy Tropical Sunfruit at Highbank's Innkeeper Francis or Dragonmaw Port's Lizzy 'Lemons'.\n\n7. Drink all four crafted drinks and check all TEN entries. Learning a recipe or buying its ingredients does not grant drinking credit. Ordinary Refreshing Spring Water is an ingredient here, not a replacement for one of the three required higher-level waters.",
        stepCount = 7,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 84, x = 0.604, y = 0.752, step = 2, label = "Allison - three required waters" },
