        difficultyReason = "Gather twenty Twisted Spirits in Jin'do's spirit phase and kill them within fifteen seconds.",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Gather twenty Twisted Spirits in Jin'do's spirit phase and kill them within fifteen seconds.\n\n1. Enter Zul'Gurub on Heroic, defeat Venoxis and reach Jin'do's upper platform. Clear the approach and disable passive damage so newly spawned spirits are not killed one by one.\n\n2. Bring Jin'do into his spirit phase, around 70% health, then stop damage to the encounter objectives. Leave the spirit chains intact while Twisted Spirits continue spawning.\n\n3. Run broad circles around the platform or stand safely at a corner at high level, gathering at least TWENTY spirits alive together. Avoid Shadow Spike ground warnings. Do not use a damaging ground effect while collecting them.\n\n4. Once enough are grouped, kill the whole pack with your own area damage inside fifteen seconds. The achievement can appear during the fight; Jin'do does not have to die for this particular objective. If continuing the clear, use a Gurubashi Spirit's Body Slam to break the chain shields before destroying the chains.",
