        difficultyReason = "Stay within Daakara's marked central rectangle from the pull until his death.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Stay within Daakara's marked central rectangle from the pull until his death.\n\n1. Select legacy Quel'Thalas through Zidormi and enter Heroic Zul'Aman in Ghostlands. Defeat the preceding bosses and reach Daakara. Identify the rectangular stone inlay on his floor before starting.\n\n2. Move EVERY player inside the rectangle first, then pull Daakara into it from range. At a high Retail level, kill him directly without leaving the rectangle; do not body-pull from beyond its boundary.\n\n3. If the fight lasts through transformations, dodge fire columns and tornadoes while remaining inside the marked floor. Keep the boss in the middle so movement leaves room on every side. Finish him without anyone stepping outside during combat.",
