    [5761] = {
        achievementId = 5761,
        name = "Hex Mix",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Hex Mix",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Collect Amani Hex Sticks and repeatedly unhex frogs until every named victim has appeared.",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Collect Amani Hex Sticks and repeatedly unhex frogs until every named victim has appeared.\n\n1. Select the legacy Ghostlands phase with Zidormi at Thalassian Pass and enter Zul'Aman on Heroic. Bring free bag space. You need Amani Hex Sticks; they are tradeable, so check the Auction House if available stock is affordable.\n\n2. Otherwise kill and loot the dungeon's trash, including the southern village, while avoiding boss kills if you want to reset and farm more immediately. Exit, reset from outside and repeat as needed, respecting the instance-entry limit. A boss kill can save your Heroic run until the daily reset.\n\n3. Find Forest Frogs around the central water, roughly 44,53. Target a frog and use an Amani Hex Stick. Wait for its transformation and dialogue, and check your named achievement criteria. Other party members' unhexes can also count while you are present.\n\n4. Continue until all twelve victims have appeared. Outcomes can repeat: twelve sticks do NOT guarantee twelve unique people, and specific frog coordinates do not guarantee a specific victim. Mojo and the treasure left by some victims are extra rewards rather than replacements for a missing name.",
