    [5765] = {
        achievementId = 5765,
        name = "Here, Kitty Kitty...",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Here, Kitty Kitty...",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Feed four different cats in one encounter without killing Kilnara; a group simplifies rat supply.",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Feed four different cats in one encounter without killing Kilnara; a group simplifies rat supply.\n\n1. Enter Heroic Zul'Gurub and reach the Temple of Bethekk. Clear the approach and pick up a Temple Rat from the floor ABOVE Kilnara before entering her chamber. Each player can carry only one; bringing four rat-carrying players avoids the solo collection problem.\n\n2. Start Kilnara without damaging her and preserve the sleeping Pride of Bethekk in her room. Wake ONE cat with a non-damaging taunt or harmless control, place your rat beside it and wait until the cat eats it and gains its enlarged frenzy appearance. A rat placed beside a sleeping, unengaged cat may be wasted.\n\n3. With a group, have the next players each feed a DIFFERENT cat in the same pull. Kill a fed cat with single-target damage if needed, but keep Kilnara and the other cats alive. Feed four cats before finishing her; partial feeds from different attempts do not accumulate.\n\n4. For the reported solo route, enable the Interact Key option AND bind Interact with Target. Use /target Temple Rat at the entrance wall, then move close to its path and interact when it is within reach. Later Retail comments confirm collecting the respawning rat this way, though positioning is sensitive. Wait about a minute for another rat and repeat the wake-and-feed process on a fresh cat.\n\n5. If the rat cannot be reached in your current attempt, use the four-player supply route rather than killing Kilnara with incomplete feeds. After four cats are credited, defeat her and check the achievement. Do not treat the fixed 9.2 rat-interaction bug as proof the achievement is permanently unavailable.",
        waypoints = {
            {
                mapID = 50,
                x = 0.721,
                y = 0.32899999999999996,
                step = 1,
                label = "Zul'Gurub - Heroic dungeon entrance",
                mapName = "Northern Stranglethorn",
